# Stmt: By.ByDefStmt inline header goal
# Run: litex -f examples/stmt_nodes/by/by_def_inline.lit
#
# When: `by def <fact>` with the goal on the header (no `?` block).
# After: same as block `by def:` — explicit definition check commits the fact.
# Example: by def {1} $subset {1}

by def {1} $subset {1}
